# Outputs
results/*
# ... except the trained networks of the benchmark surrogate (*.pt via Git LFS, see
# .gitattributes). The dataset (~2.3 GB) stays local: `suspkin surrogate sample` rebuilds it.
!results/benchmark_surrogate/
